You are using go version go1.23.4

- Minimize Nesting
- Refactor for smaller more testable functions
- Always write tests for code you write to verify functionality using the standard library. Ask before using a third party library 
- Always execute the tests you wrote to make sure your code works as you expect
- Make sure we are getting sufficient code coverage
- Use verbose debug logging to help diagnose issues

